  "bodyHash": "e10c8f2abebb3005",
  "content": "\n\n<p>Pretty Rain 以更具美感的粒子效果取代預設天氣。為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/particle-rain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particle Rain</a> 的 Fabric 移植版。</p>\n<p>歡迎加入我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/m4EHeRjfZ9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 尋求支援！⚠️<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">在 1.20.1 及更早版本中，伺服器必須安裝此模組⚠️</span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>若嵌入影片無法載入，請使用以下網址：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%252fembed%252foan4xH5RvH0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0</a></p>\n<h3><strong>雨滴粒子</strong></h3>\n<p>呈傾斜落下，宛如受風吹拂。暴風天氣時風勢更強。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\"></p>\n<h3><strong>雪花粒子</strong></h3>\n<p>下落時緩慢旋轉。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\"></p>\n<h3><strong>沙塵暴</strong></h3>\n<p>塵土與灌木隨風飄過沙漠及其他乾燥生態域。支援模組新增的生態域。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\"></p>\n<h3><strong>生態域色調</strong></h3>\n<p>雨水與水粒子會匹配該生態域的水體色調。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\"></p>\n<h3><strong>水面漣漪</strong></h3>\n<p>當雨水落在水面時會出現。解析度會與您的資源包保持一致。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\"></p>\n<h3><strong>水流痕跡</strong></h3>\n<p>當雨水擊中由硬質材質構成的牆壁時會出現。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\"></p>\n<h3><strong>地表霧氣</strong></h3>\n<p>在潮濕生態域的海平面附近出現。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\"></p>\n<h3><strong>更濃的霧？</strong></h3>\n<p>實驗性功能，可能導致卡頓，預設為關閉。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\"></p>\n<h3><strong>可自訂設定</strong></h3>\n<p>若您已安裝 Mod Menu，即可調整粒子的多種行為參數。所有效果皆可自由開關。</p>\n<p>（NeoForge 版本暫無設定介面，但即將推出）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f8482acefabfb7deeb3b56af16b9f4bc35e8c892.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f8482acefabfb7deeb3b56af16b9f4bc35e8c892.png\"></p>\n<h3><strong>降低延遲的建議</strong></h3>\n<p>請在設定檔中調低半徑、密度或最大粒子數量。預設情況下，粒子雨最多只會生成 1500 個粒子。大多數系統應能順暢運行。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您想支持我以及我的模組開發，我推薦您嘗試 BisectHosting。使用優惠碼「project8gbderam」，新客戶購買遊戲主機首月可享 25% 折扣。他們提供 24/7 客服支援與極速回覆，確保您的遊戲體驗萬無一失，並為您提供卓越的服務。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/project8gbderam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/project8gbderam</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/54bb107c-f9fc-4f32-8515-fb4e3d56c124.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
